19
00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:34.600
[grunts]

20
00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.160
[grunting]

21
00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:50.480
[groans]

22
00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:55.400
