[gasps]

34
00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:37.240
-[yells]
-[gasps]

35
00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:40.840
[screaming]

36
00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:45.840
[grunts]

37
00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.200
