38
00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.280
[sighs]

39
00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.000
[laughs]

40
00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.040
[gasps]

41
00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.320
[giggles]

42
